    "body": "1. As the title says, this optimization must be in **path start state**, but you added it to **relative slash state**; by mistake?\r\n2. I think this optimization can be applied if `c` is `/`, `\\`  or EOF, not just `/`. After all, `http://h/`, `http://h\\` and `http://h` are parsed to `http://h/`.\r\n3. I guess the added step must return *url*, not *output*.",
